r is a property and not a node\n\nA selector is not a thing in the system; it is how to reach one. Landing\n`#archive` as an entity would put a CSS string in the label space and hand a\nreviewer something to approve that is not a fact about the system. So\n`edges_for` skips property-valued joins and `properties_for` picks them up.\n entity storage STORED IN query target route page element selector tag entity record tag edges for properties for", ordinal: 4}, {lifecycle_state: "Quarantine", path: "05-the-two-gates.md", m_project: "metis", source_episode_id: "ep-lessons-f300da3676163a62", embedding_model: "minishlab/potion-base-8M", name: "The two gates, and why there are only two", id: "lesson:05-the-two-gates", embedding: [-0.36158356070518494, 0.2243589609861374, -0.2666513919830322, -0.027494534850120544, 0.2844523787498474, 0.09146446734666824, -0.008893183432519436, -0.03275034949183464, -0.006038133520632982, -0.011151844635605812, -0.13593794405460358, 0.01830321177840233, -0.10906761884689331, -0.04581897333264351, 0.061690010130405426, -0.02122196927666664, -0.014488550834357738, -0.07302471995353699, 0.058415982872247696, -0.19414351880550385, 0.06372552365064621, 0.10535220056772232, -0.08225496858358383, -0.15396809577941895, -0.12482692301273346, 0.026296870782971382, -0.004583962261676788, -0.09900300949811935, 0.028798073530197144, 0.06325031071901321, -0.014920419082045555, 0.07541784644126892, -0.04132350534200668, -0.009367630816996098, 0.10345876216888428, 0.048029713332653046, 0.12625281512737274, -0.07110505551099777, -0.0287545844912529, 0.0057560112327337265, 0.005144184920936823, -0.04000857472419739, 0.06224910914897919, -0.12386298179626465, 0.1366463154554367, -0.06186589226126671, 0.06628532707691193, -0.09686394780874252, -0.042752962559461594, 0.013099909760057926, -0.013232085853815079, -0.101519875228405, 0.03633273020386696, 0.050107069313526154, -0.03757543861865997, 0.027125529944896698, -0.0007998865912668407, -0.004557109903544187