ss the first two already hold, and splitting\n`a AND b AND c` on `AND` cannot recover that."}, {m_project: "metis", source_episode_id: "ep-lessons-f300da3676163a62", embedding_model: "minishlab/potion-base-8M", name: "Two claims that look alike and are not", embedding: [-0.38900187611579895, 0.1346009373664856, -0.3586552143096924, -0.003766091773286462, 0.10376004874706268, 0.11575141549110413, -0.02141953818500042, -0.012732019647955894, -0.010208602994680405, 0.03821612149477005, -0.04992947727441788, 0.005992531310766935, -0.06801623106002808, -0.09737244248390198, -0.03252933546900749, -0.0440024770796299, -0.09519863873720169, -0.023248381912708282, -0.03216329216957092, -0.14154672622680664, -0.06400425732135773, 0.19914773106575012, -0.046993035823106766, -0.15720073878765106, -0.06272092461585999, 0.013373120687901974, 0.09493353962898254, -0.11695203930139542, -0.031003030017018318, 0.015448921360075474, -0.04720190912485123, 0.054346632212400436, -0.0034301632549613714, -0.021918758749961853, 0.0950908437371254, -0.030971409752964973, 0.04350487142801285, -0.07323379069566727, -0.03809220716357231, -0.031074529513716698, 0.01689857244491577, -0.08957960456609726, -0.013934718444943428, -0.06943827867507935, -0.005773334763944149, -0.02662154659628868, 0.0535220168530941, -0.11034201085567474, -0.005003139842301607, -0.010358341969549656, -0.013163617812097073, -0.037858929485082626, 0.040277354419231415, -0.008150516077876091, -0.08914975821971893, 0.033147189766168594, -0.017132123932242393, 0.06259314715862274, 0.12157176434993744, -0.06106574460864067, 0.06795981526374817, -0.03173143416643143, -0.03370284661650658, 0.03637699410319328, -0.0722169280052185, -0.023586049675941467, -0.013765374198555946, -0.09669949859380722, -0.02106844075024128, -0.0018187558744102716, 0.057680584490299225, -0.016978032886981964, 0.06385734677314758, 0.06887982040643692, -0.02280372381210327, -0.01116152573376894, 0.018053553998470306, -0.014853712171316147, -0.0708508