ansition -[:CONSTRAINED_BY]-> Check` \u2014 a condition was **found** near this\n  transition.\n- `DeclaredOutcome -[:GUARDED_BY]-> Check` \u2014 this condition **selected** this\n  outcome over its siblings.\n\nLanding refuses to conflate them and so does every reader. A reviewer approves\nthe two differently.", search_text: "Two claims that look alike and are not ## Two claims that look alike and are not\n\n- `Transition -[:CONSTRAINED_BY]-> Check` \u2014 a condition was **found** near this\n  transition.\n- `DeclaredOutcome -[:GUARDED_BY]-> Check` \u2014 this condition **selected** this\n  outcome over its siblings.\n\nLanding refuses to conflate them and so does every reader. A reviewer approves\nthe two differently. CONSTRAINED BY GUARDED BY", ordinal: 5}, {m_project: "metis", source_episode_id: "ep-lessons-f300da3676163a62", embedding_model: "minishlab/potion-base-8M", name: "Derived, never authored", id: "lesson:03-facts-and-evidence#06", text: "## Derived, never authored\n\n**T-9b.** Anything M\u00e9tis generates says where it came from. **T-9c**: it states\nconditions, never values. **T-9d**: what could not be recovered is *marked*, not\nguessed \u2014 which is why a Page Object method with no recovered selector raises\n`NotImplementedError` naming the reason instead of clicking a plausible CSS\npath.", embedding: [-0.1740584820508957, 0.10737267136573792, -0.2564283311367035, -0.04019033908843994, 0.22722990810871124, 0.013822794891893864, -0.08735253661870956, -0.06157483905553818, -0.14587587118148804, 0.11643921583890915, -0.19777505099773407, 0.0662083774805069, -0.056940529495477676, -0.022806085646152496, -0.02187730185687542, -0.03377685695886612, -0.07358372956514359, -0.0980219691991806, 0.044295165687799454, -0.14929582178592682, -0.012518058530986309, 0.1880791038274765, 0.06014341861009598, 0.009942656382918358, -0.045687127858400345, 0.03753015771508217, 0.06840407848358154, -0.006541311740875244, 0.017965495586395264, 0.07552467286586761, -0.