comparing what the code does **now** against what was said\n**then** cannot express *\"true until release 4.2\"* with a review state alone\n(**D-15**). lifecycle state valid from valid to", ordinal: 1}, {m_project: "metis", source_episode_id: "ep-lessons-f300da3676163a62", embedding_model: "minishlab/potion-base-8M", name: "Empty means still true", text: "## Empty means still true\n\n`valid_to` is required and **may be empty**. `\"\"` is the honest representation of\n\"still true\"; absent would be indistinguishable from \"nobody recorded it\" \u2014 the\nsame conflation `guard_expression` refuses for unguarded transitions.", id: "lesson:07-time-what-was-true-and-when#02", embedding: [-0.4095698595046997, 0.0677732601761818, -0.22268472611904144, 0.022755321115255356, 0.26739007234573364, 0.09864924848079681, 0.0190396998077631, 0.08320309221744537, 8.56852566357702e-05, -0.03289462998509407, -0.0908612608909607, 0.07785330712795258, -0.17087052762508392, 0.015237164683640003, -0.03470093384385109, -0.060921307653188705, -0.009726325049996376, -0.045086368918418884, -0.01551096048206091, -0.18802134692668915, 0.0010471254354342818, 0.12904991209506989, -0.021961018443107605, -0.0871739313006401, -0.11203556507825851, 0.14309269189834595, 0.0786602571606636, -0.16775861382484436, 0.011307197622954845, -0.030663423240184784, -0.10217892378568649, -0.029904702678322792, -0.012448476627469063, -0.028264902532100677, 0.00923483818769455, 0.0075147259049117565, -0.036381497979164124, 0.0224652960896492, -0.031240740790963173, -0.007720261812210083, -0.10177802294492722, 0.002538978587836027, -0.004629156552255154, -0.056045882403850555, 0.005354873836040497, -0.04662639647722244, 0.06190677359700203, -0.0005300012417137623, -0.03522566705942154, 0.008024781942367554, -0.10770107805728912, -0.08836009353399277, -0.0246509350836277, -0.05335240811109543, 0.01892699860036373, 0.04142029955983162, -0.06230688467621803, 0.005598945543169975, -0.018175756558775902, -0.044781651